Output trigpoint.gif
Set Shell bash
Set Width 1100
Set Height 640
Set FontSize 16
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 60ms

Hide
Type "bash /vhs/setup.sh && clear" Enter
Sleep 2s
Show

Type "trig" Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "n"
Sleep 500ms
Type "api"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "l"
Sleep 300ms
Type "n"
Sleep 500ms
Type "web"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "l"
Sleep 300ms
Type "a"
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 1s
Backspace 4
Type "indexer"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 4s

Sleep 8s

Enter
Sleep 3s
Type "echo the agent's own terminal, handed over whole" Enter
Sleep 2s

Alt+q
Sleep 3s

Type "q"
Sleep 2s
